{"about_the_game":"Have you ever wondered what it would be like to be a Mouse? Have you ever wondered what it would be like to be inside of a Maze? Wonder no more! In R.A.T.T.Z. Maze you will have to rely on the mouse to smell, and your brain to remember! <br><br>If you ever wanted to be experimented on, wait no more! R.A.T.T.Z. Maze is the control run for future testing. How fast can you finish all of the mazes? <br>How many rewards can you get? How much can you improve your runtime? Do your best, this is your control run! <br><br>Welcome to the Maze, Good luck!<br><br><br>-----------<br><br>What is this game about?<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experiencing the simple life of a Mouse.<br></li><li>Running around in cardboard mazes.<br></li><li>Getting a reward every time you find the button.<br></li><li>Seeing how much time it took to get as far as you did last run.<br></li><li>12 starter levels to run through.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2291660?t=1772117478","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2291660?t=1772117478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772117478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772117478","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Have you ever wondered what it would be like to be a Mouse? Have you ever wondered what it would be like to be inside of a Maze? Wonder no more! In R.A.T.T.Z. Maze you will have to rely on the mouse to smell, and your brain to remember! <br><br>If you ever wanted to be experimented on, wait no more! R.A.T.T.Z. Maze is the control run for future testing. How fast can you finish all of the mazes? <br>How many rewards can you get? How m